// Same racer at 03:00: sparse patrols, short witness range, slow civilian reports. Pursuit takes
// longer than 60 s on average (a patrol can still happen to be right there) and reinforcements arrive slower (ratios asserted in tests/police_scenarios.rs).
//
// Seed 14 since the road network centreline fix (centrelines follow the road centre, not the
// first lane): seed 100's mean start fell from 102 s to 45 s. It was the outlier, not the
// rule: on seeds 11-14 main gave 36-51 s (all under 60) and the fix gives 44-73 s.
(
    name: "police_night_core_speeder",
    seed: 14,
    time_of_day_h: 3.0,
    duration_s: 480.0,
    runs: 8,
    racers: [(district: Core, speed_factor: 2.0)],
    expect: [
        (metric: "pursuit_start_s", min: 60.0, max: 10000.0),
    ],
)
